========================================================================================================
HOW TO READ THIS
========================================================================================================
  alpha << 1 in the violation buckets while the POOLED alpha is ~1 means the
  ladder gap DOES mean-revert where it matters, and the training metric was
  diluted by the 80%+ of pairs sitting at parity. The fix is to weight the
  ladder loss toward violations -- not to drop the mechanism.

  alpha ~ 1 in EVERY bucket means the gap is a random walk at this resolution
  and the negative result stands on its own terms.

  'mean t+h' against 'mean gap t' is the same story without the algebra:
  if large violations shrink toward zero, reversion is real.
